Provides a wrapper to the ImageMagick/GraphicsMagick library; here with
ImageMagick 7 (the package ImageMagick7).

PECL imagick for php74 of azsupport/ports, built from ext/imagick of
the release tarball of azsupport/php-src, which bundles it:
lib/php/20190902/imagick.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php74/conf.d.
